  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GI, Corporal punishment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">GI, aga 2008-10</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GI is a project aiming to end the use of corporal punishment of children around the world. The project is mapping in which countries it is legally allowed to use corporal punishment and where it is criminalised. The purpose is develop knowledge and staticial information about the use of corporal punishment and its long term consequences.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Global Initiative to end all forms of corporal punishment of children (GI) &#xe4;r ett projekt som syftar till f&#xe5; tillst&#xe5;nd f&#xf6;rbud mot aga av barn i alla v&#xe4;rldens l&#xe4;nder. En del av projektet har kartlagt i vilka delar aga &#xe4;r lagligt och var det &#xe4;r kriminaliserat. Projektet kommer att leda till en slutrapport om l&#xe4;get i v&#xe4;rlden. GI har t ex bidragit med fakta till FN&apos;s studie om v&#xe5;ld mot barn.</narrative>
  </description>
